<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Auto Stack Deck Opener of first column</Major>
    <Description>This macro helps with opening the stacked decks in the inventory. It only opens the first row in the left of the inventory. You need to go to the menagerie or the delve to be able to open and not erase the cards. After some cards are dropped to the floor, it's necessary for you to move to another place because there will be a lot of cards on the floor and you'll not be able to drop any more cards. Works in 1920x1080 resolution.</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>MoveTo 1035 490
Delay 20 ms
RightDown 1
Delay 20 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 20 ms
MoveTo 975 490
Delay 20 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 20 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 20 ms
GoWhile 1 10
MoveTo 1035 535
Delay 20 ms
RightDown 1
Delay 20 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 20 ms
MoveTo 975 535
Delay 20 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 20 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 20 ms
GoWhile 14 10
MoveTo 1035 575
Delay 20 ms
