RightUp 1
Delay 20 ms
MoveTo 975 665
Delay 20 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 20 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 20 ms
GoWhile 53 10</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Path of Exile</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>